(text "C1: place at U3 VIN/GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 81.28 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5fa7d76b-13e2-4b3e-b403-4e1fcead1645"))
(text "AUDIO NOTES\n- VIN from 5V (Feather USB pin) for full output; 3.3V works but is much quieter.\n- C1 sits right at the amp's VIN/GND on the breadboard to stop brownout resets on loud peaks.\n- GAIN unconnected = 9 dB. SD unconnected = (L+R)/2 mono mix via the board's on-board resistor.\n- Do NOT tie SD straight to a 3.3V GPIO: a solid high selects LEFT channel only. If you want\n  GPIO mute, check the MAX98357A datasheet SD_MODE thresholds and size a series resistor first.\n- Speaker goes across SPK+ / SPK-. Outputs are bridge-tied: never connect either one to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 127 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "768294bf-51a0-4f4c-ade2-145d9e30db86"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
